NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATASETS:

This repository uses the Spider dataset (Yu et al., 2018), which is licensed
under CC BY-SA 4.0 by its original authors. The dataset is not redistributed
with this repository; it is downloaded on-demand from the Hugging Face Hub
(xlangai/spider). Users of this repository must comply with the Spider
dataset's own license terms when using the data.

Original Spider dataset citation:
Yu, T., Zhang, R., Yang, K., et al. (2018). Spider: A Large-Scale Human-Labeled
Dataset for Complex and Cross-Domain Semantic Parsing and Text-to-SQL Task.
Proceedings of EMNLP 2018, pp. 3911-3921.
https://aclanthology.org/D18-1425/
